  "solution": {
    "text": "Just after cutting the string 1 the extension of the string will remain same as it was before cutting the string '1'. So, we can take string force on block is equal '2g'.<br /><br />Now making F.B.D of block 'B'.<br /><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></math> .... (i)<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0009_c4b85070b756.jpeg\" /><br /><br />Making F.B.D of block 'c'<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0009_c83f8fa71c2b.jpeg\" /><br /><br /><math><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi></math> .... (ii)<br /><br />From (i) and (ii)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
